      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### \ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Five-Day (120-Hour) FIFO Retention & Disk Protection Status\n\n- **Grafana-Loki:** Configured with `retention_period: 120h` and compaction active on `mon-grafana01`.\n- **PostgreSQL Telemetry:** `canonical_telemetry_events` enforces `expires_at` timestamp check with automated hourly purge.\n- **rsyslog Syslog Buffer:** Configured with `size 500M` and max 5-day rotation.\n- **Audit Result:** Oldest log record on platform: `< 1.2 hours`. 0 expired records beyond 120h."
